  {
    q: 'Is European shoe sizing unisex?',
    a: 'Yes, European (EU) shoe sizes are unisex. Unlike the American system where a men\'s size 9 is significantly larger than a women\'s size 9, an EU 42 represents the identical 27.0 cm footbed length whether designed for a man or a woman.'
